  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Series title from rear cover; colophon identifies series as Colección Del San Juan.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Colophon: "...consta de cien ejemplares manufacturados e iluminados a mano por las Ediciones Vigía en su Colección Del San Juan. En su realización se emplearon papeles rojo, verde y amarillo, de diferentes texturas y gramajes, acrílicos y tintas. Edición: Agustina Ponce...."</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Bound in brown cardboard covers decorated with colored paper cut-out of the head of a man/woman in red and neon green; title spelled out in neon green paper letters affixed to front cover; cut-out of the Ediciones Vigía oil lamp logo, hand-colored in brown, yelow, and green, affixed to rear cover; decorated endpapers; poems illustrated by Frank David Valdés Hernández with full-page drawings and decorative cut-outs on red, yellow, and brown paper.</subfield>
  </datafield>
